        "origin": "authoring_observation",
        "status": "suspected",
        "classification": "defect",
        "description": "The new scale operation does not supply the missing file-dtype support needed to load actual FP8 weights.",
        "trigger": "Linear.load selects ordinary weights whose safetensors dtype is an FP8 identifier.",
        "expected_behavior": "Decode the FP8 weights into a supported dense dtype and apply the companion scales.",
        "actual_behavior": "SafetensorsCollection.get_tensor calls convert_dtype first. It recognizes only I32, I16, F16, BF16 and F32, and raises ValueError for other identifiers before the scale helper can run. This inherited loader restriction remains unchanged.",
        "locations": [
          {
            "commit": "d860f8e1e106a45536603cd8069fc9ef43105fd9",
            "path": "exllamav3/modules/linear.py",
            "symbol": "Linear.load_fp16"
